  "adaptations": [
    "Protocol version5 adds collision metadata and four dynamic vectors; State records156bytes, seven records per1132byte packet.",
    "Extract existing local collider/environment reads without changing callback, query, timing, RNG or CMoveMgr behavior. Solo presentation opts out of the extra wire capture.",
    "Client reconstructs primary and shape geometry from independently mounted/decoded DAT; existing ContainerShape build and basis-relative transform arithmetic preserved, including actual shape origin and transformed status.",
    "Object/physics candidate frames commit together; invalid geometry or bindings cannot advance accepted histories.",
    "No new game algorithm or commercial asset import; original collision/container movement rules remain at the prior ported boundaries."
  ]
